{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"media","input":{"id":76866,"type":"tv"},"checkedAt":1793644277387,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":76866,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76866","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T18:31:17.386Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"HUG! Pretty Cure","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"HUGっと！プリキュア","overview":{"value":"Nono Hana is a middle school student who encounters a baby named Hug-tan and her guardian, Harry, who fell from the sky. Hana learns that they have been pursued by the evil Criasu Corporation, who wants Hug-tan's Mirai Crystal and change the present. Protecting Hug-tan causes Hana to gain her own Mirai Crystal and transform into the Pretty Cure of High Spirits, Cure Yell.","language":"en-US"},"tagline":{"value":"なんでもできる！なんでもなれる！輝く未来を抱きしめて！","language":"ja-JP"},"startDate":"2018-02-04","endDate":"2019-01-27","status":"Ended","rating":8,"ratingCount":16,"numberOfEpisodes":49,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Commedia","Animazione","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Famiglia","Kids"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"24m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":103,"name":"tv asahi","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j3xAzk1SYQQwrQOD7acdSz675Wa.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2019928,"name":"Rie Hikisaka","role":"Hana Nono / Cure Yell (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A2qoMAgTD0uG49HhQLkHmWquSiP.jpg"},{"id":2285491,"name":"Rina Honnizumi","role":"Saaya Yakushiji / Cure Ange (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5p8wWjqrBHTkOPC5txO1eUXRBRY.jpg"},{"id":1057990,"name":"Yui Ogura","role":"Homare Kagayaki / Cure Étoile (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vUuyLWde2CEd5G0oqeEzzFE6qqA.jpg"},{"id":1325963,"name":"Nao Tamura","role":"Emiru Aisaki / Cure Macherie (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zZKM9EU769hEiQWcQWkT9AAPFp9.jpg"},{"id":203268,"name":"Yukari Tamura","role":"Lulu Amour / Cure Amour (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AigHQPetpcKee62ekHsYFSpQeWE.jpg"},{"id":1256107,"name":"Konomi Tada","role":"Hug-tan (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cwosbs42zgvEQwcsExockFPxFux.jpg"},{"id":216449,"name":"Junko Noda","role":"Hariham Harry (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCxTwFNdjTABu5jiMmzvcBSqTTi.jpg"},{"id":115301,"name":"Jun Fukushima","role":"Hariham Harry (human) (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xo2A4cr8TnhC9rLFxSQvhwCbIOw.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"HUG! Pretty Cure","overview":"Nono Hana is a middle school student who encounters a baby named Hug-tan and her guardian, Harry, who fell from the sky. Hana learns that they have been pursued by the evil Criasu Corporation, who wants Hug-tan's Mirai Crystal and change the present. Protecting Hug-tan causes Hana to gain her own Mirai Crystal and transform into the Pretty Cure of High Spirits, Cure Yell."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"超イケてる大人のお姉さんになりたい中学２年生の野乃はな。前髪を切り過ぎるわ遅刻はするわで転校初日は大失敗。でも、なんだか素敵な出会いもあったりまた明日からの日々に胸躍らせていたところ、空から降ってきた不思議な赤ちゃん「はぐたん」と、そのお世話係（？）のハムスター「ハリー」と出会います。\n\nそこへ「クライアス社」という悪い組織がはぐたんの持つ「ミライクリスタル」を狙って現れ、怪物を出して襲ってきたのです。\n\nはぐたんを守りたい！というはなの強い気持ちによって新たなミライクリスタルが生まれると、はなは元気のプリキュア・キュアエールに変身します。\n\nミライクリスタルとは、この世界にあふれている明日をつくる力・アスパワワの結晶。これが奪われてしまうと、みんなの未来が無くなってしまいます。みんなの未来、そしてはぐたん。\n\n大切なものを守るためのキュアエールの物語が今幕を開けます。","tagline":"なんでもできる！なんでもなれる！輝く未来を抱きしめて！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sHPQqwf23xSf0yRyoLPRRpb79mn.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sHPQqwf23xSf0yRyoLPRRpb79mn.png","language":"ja","width":649,"height":290}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xY8RG5C7X28g9v8l8mBK137L2ER.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xY8RG5C7X28g9v8l8mBK137L2ER.jpg","language":"ja","width":1138,"height":1707}